<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan crude imports rise 3.7 pct yr/yr - MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan crude imports rise 3.7 pct yr/yr - MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Monday issued the following data on crude oil imports during January 1997:</p>
<p> CRUDE OIL   (1,000 kl) (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p> Iran	   2,308	 14,517    + 1.9    + 4.3</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia 5,280	 33,211    - 7.1    +18.7</p>
<p> Kuwait	 1,646	 10,353    +42.9    +21.6</p>
<p> Neutral Zone 1,374	  8,642    +42.2    +14.3</p>
<p> Qatar	  1,158	  7,284    + 0.6    -20.7</p>
<p> Oman	   1,469	  9,240    - 2.4    +18.5</p>
<p> UAE	    7,319	 46,037    +20.5    +17.9</p>
<p> China	    996	  6,265    -13.4    - 7.6</p>
<p> Malaysia	 509	  3,202    + 7.5    -15.9</p>
<p> Brunei	    82	    516    -64.7    -74.3</p>
<p> Indonesia    1,346	  8,466    -11.7    -27.1</p>
<p> Vietnam	  320	  2,013    +26.0    -26.9</p>
<p> Mexico	   131	    824    -68.1    -11.6</p>
<p> Nigeria	  164	  1,032    -----    -15.5</p>
<p> Australia	211	  1,327    -23.8    -----</p>
<p> TOTAL	 24,314	152,935    + 5.2    + 3.7</p>
<p>(Figures may not tally due to rounding off)</p>
</text>
